    <briefdescription>
<para>A utility pass that does nothing, but preserves no analyses. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Because this preserves no analyses, any analysis passes queried after this pass runs will recompute fresh results. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
